WEBVTT

00:10:57.240 --> 00:11:00.936
To ni čedno, simetrično Valentinovo srce.

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:03.094
Je telesno, sistemsko,

00:11:03.118 --> 00:11:08.114
je grd par ovnovih rogov,
pokopan nekje globoko v tvoji lobanji

00:11:08.138 --> 00:11:10.458
in ko pride mimo tisti posebni fant,

00:11:10.482 --> 00:11:11.911
se osvetli,

00:11:11.935 --> 00:11:14.861
in če si mu tudi ti všeč
in drug drugega osrečujeta,

00:11:14.885 --> 00:11:16.504
potem podpihuješ plamene.

00:11:16.528 --> 00:11:17.950
Če pa ne,

00:11:17.974 --> 00:11:20.025
potem zbereš tim nevroznanstvenikov,

00:11:20.049 --> 00:11:21.683
da jih izbriseš na silo.

00:11:21.707 --> 00:11:23.617
(smeh)

00:11:23.641 --> 00:11:24.876
Hvala.

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:27.405
(aplavz)